  "hints": [
    "Feed P directly into the A inputs (A1-A4) of the 7483.",
    "Pass each Q bit through an XOR gate with its second input tied to VCC (+5V) to invert it (Q').",
    "Connect Carry-In (C0, pin 13) of the 7483 directly to VCC (+5V) to add the +1 for 2's complement.",
    "Do not forget VCC (pin 5) and GND (pin 12) on the 7483 IC."
  ]
